.TH FRAMEWORK 1 "2026-11-01" "framework 0.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
framework \- POSIX.1-2017-targeted Lua 5.4 dataflow framework
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B make
.RI [ target ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B framework
runs declared dataflow stages under
.BR sh (1),
with Lua 5.4 modules for pure transforms and validation.
Every stage has a contract, a refinement, a test, and a checksum.
.PP
The framework targets POSIX.1-2017. It does not use non-POSIX shell
extensions such as
.BR local ,
.BR timeout ,
.BR mktemp ,
or
.BR bc .
.SH TARGETS
.TP
.B verify
Run every core gate in order.
.TP
.B audit
Scan source for forbidden utilities and options.
.TP
.B test
Run unit, property, contract, and integration tests.
.TP
.B proof
Validate every
.I .refine
obligation.
.TP
.B build
Compile stripped Lua 5.4 bytecode into
.IR build/bytecode .
.TP
.B man
Lint and render the manual page.
.TP
.B plugins
Run the opt-in plugin gate.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 success, 1 transform or edge failure, 3 validation failure,
4 environment failure, 5 proof failure.
.SH FILES
.I etc/posix_allowlist.txt
and
.I etc/banned_options.txt
are the policy sources.
.I etc/framework.conf
holds non-secret configuration.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sh (1),
.BR lua5.4 (1),
.BR cksum (1),
.BR sqlite3 (1)
